[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3602.87, "timestamp": "01:00:02", "text": "新的。啊。這，這，這是新的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3606.069, "timestamp": "01:00:06", "text": "這是正確的。啊，這位虛擬主播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3610.71, "timestamp": "01:00:10", "text": "這是《時尚》雜誌六月刊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3614.789, "timestamp": "01:00:14", "text": "但這太神奇了。這不是很神奇嗎？驚人的！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3620.589, "timestamp": "01:00:20", "text": "正確的？這是，呃，之前的，呃，封面。在後面"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3624.029, "timestamp": "01:00:24", "text": "就是這樣。這是背面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3628.71, "timestamp": "01:00:28", "text": "這不令人驚嘆嗎？我想買這個。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3634.789, "timestamp": "01:00:34", "text": "現在已經五月了，五月嘛，VTuber（虛擬主播）嘛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3640.19, "timestamp": "01:00:40", "text": "時尚雜誌也可能包含在內。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3646.549, "timestamp": "01:00:46", "text": "但是，在哪裡呢？在哪裡？我試著找找看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3650.27, "timestamp": "01:00:50", "text": "不掛。我快速看一下。在哪裡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3653.19, "timestamp": "01:00:53", "text": "它在哪裡？它在哪裡？在哪裡？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3657.27, "timestamp": "01:00:57", "text": "是這張照片嗎？"}]